-- Verify the operations of timestamptz that need a time zone, which ty's zones
-- (ty/DESIGN.md section 20) serve: the casts, AT TIME ZONE, the fields, the
-- truncation, the arithmetic across a daylight time, and the text. The session's
-- zone changes; the instants are around the transitions of several zones.
SET datestyle = 'ISO, MDY';
SET timezone = 'UTC';
